.lake/
build/
*.olean
*.mutbak
*.bak

# release artifacts built by checker/release-package.sh (never committed:
# they are rebuilt from the tree and uploaded to a GitHub Release)
.release/

# Session checkpoints -- LOCAL ONLY, never published.
# They are working notes: dated, written mid-session, and about the state of one
# machine's tree at one moment. Publishing them puts a record of the past in a
# repository whose every other surface is required to describe the present, and
# `checker/repo-complete.sh` had to carry a permanent exemption to stop scanning
# them for stale numbers. Kept on disk, out of git.
TASKS/

# Local-only 1.0.x release artifacts (checker/release-local.sh). Built from HEAD,
# stamped, installed into CTT for testing -- never published until the promise is earned.
.release-local-only/
.release-local-only.count

# cocoindex-code (ccc) semantic index. A machine-local embedding database of THIS
# checkout: it names absolute paths and is rebuilt from the tree in seconds, so it
# is worthless to anyone else and is a local-path leak if it ever ships. Binary,
# which means checker/no-local-paths.sh cannot see inside it (grep -rI skips
# binaries -- the exact way the bonus/cmdpulse archive leaked). Excluded from the
# release tarball at checker/release-package.sh as well; ignoring it here is only
# half the guard.
.cocoindex_code/
